COMPILATION OF: E46L11

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L11 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 3, AUTO STORAGE 4 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 Q FLOAT BINARY(24,0) AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L11

   1 a 0000 E46L11:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 c 0006   dcl outf file, q float;
   4 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('L11OUT DAT');
   5 c 0023   put file(outf) list(q);
   6 c 003D   put list(q);
   7 c 0054   close file(outf);
   8 a 005A end E46L11;

CODE SIZE = 005D
DATA AREA = 000E
FREE SYMS = 38A5
